 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "I count the harvest in baskets, but I know something is wrong when I cannot hear the birds. Defeat five Unlicensed Poachers after dark in the Lorindor Berrywoods southeast of Lorindor Berrycourt, where their nets have emptied the branches. A berrywood ought to offer more than fruit and silence.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "giver_name": "Ilwen Petalmeasure",
   "giver_settlement": "Lorindor Berrycourt",
   "id": "lorindor_berries_01",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 unlicensed_poacher [in elandor_lorindor/berrywoods]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_lorindor/berrywoods",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:unlicensed_poacher"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Harvest Should Have a Song",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "xp": 338
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "The Toll Mirefolk at Whitepetal Fenhold southeast from here demand a pearl for every crate my carters carry. Defeat five of them, by day or night, and approach from the edge of the camp so they cannot all rush you together. At these rates, I shall soon be packing pearls and charging extra for the berries.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "giver_name": "Ilwen Petalmeasure",
   "giver_settlement": "Lorindor Berrycourt",
   "id": "lorindor_berries_02",
   "min_level": 22,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 toll_mirefolk [in elandor_lorindor/fenhold]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_lorindor/fenhold",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:toll_mirefolk"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "lorindor_berries_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Pearl for Every Basket",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "xp": 350
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "The Unlicensed Poachers return to the Lorindor Berrywoods southeast of Lorindor Berrycourt whenever they think we have stopped listening. Defeat six after dark and return to me for Berrycourt's payment. This bounty remains available for further hunts; I intend to hear birds here next harvest too.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "giver_name": "Ilwen Petalmeasure",
   "giver_settlement": "Lorindor Berrycourt",
   "id": "lorindor_berries_bounty",
   "min_level": 22,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 unlicensed_poacher [in elandor_lorindor/berrywoods]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_lorindor/berrywoods",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:unlicensed_poacher"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "lorindor_berries_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Bounty: Keep a Song in the Branches (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "xp": 270
  },
  {
   "copper": 19,
   "description": "These roots held the earth before anyone thought to call us the Accord; I mean to repay the favour. Alloy iron with coal and bring me four Steel Bars here at the cutting for the props. Check your pick before seeking the deeper seams: respect for stone begins with the right tool.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_063_host",
   "giver_name": "Saevin Rootscribe",
   "giver_settlement": "Paleroot Cutting",
   "id": "lorindor_cutting_01",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 4 grug_materials:steel_bar"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 4,
     "item": "grug_materials:steel_bar",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Give the Old Roots a Brace",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_063_host",
   "xp": 225
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Kelda Screesort at Tarncut Mine in Frostbarrow Shelf knows what stone will bear, and I value her judgment. Make the journey to her and say I sent you to help with her work. She will probably ask whether I have measured anything properly yet; tell her the roots remain entirely satisfied.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_063_host",
   "giver_name": "Saevin Rootscribe",
   "giver_settlement": "Paleroot Cutting",
   "id": "lorindor_cutting_02",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Kelda Screesort (r20_anchor_061)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_061_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "lorindor_cutting_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Rootscribe Recommends You",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "xp": 150
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Some of those toll pearls reach Highcourt, and I would like our human neighbours to know what bought them. Travel to Highcourt and speak with Mariel Waybook about Lorindor's tolls; she keeps the road accounts there. Between her ledger and mine, we may find where an honest delivery becomes somebody else's profit.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "giver_name": "Ilwen Petalmeasure",
   "giver_settlement": "Lorindor Berrycourt",
   "id": "lorindor_journeys_01",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Mariel Waybook (highcourt)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_human_capital_envoy",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "lorindor_berries_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Let the Ledgers Agree",
   "turnin": "r20_human_capital_envoy",
   "xp": 150
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Merren Oakstamp says my crates arrive half empty, as though the berries have taken a stroll. Speak with her at Whitebridge Market Close in Whitebridge Shire about the missing deliveries. It is a long journey through the human lands; a mount will spare your feet for the work awaiting you.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "giver_name": "Ilwen Petalmeasure",
   "giver_settlement": "Lorindor Berrycourt",
   "id": "lorindor_journeys_02",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Merren Oakstamp (r20_anchor_016)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
