   "title": "Bounty: A Little Help for Old Roots (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_063_host",
   "xp": 233
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "We cannot leave a lamp beside every traveller, but we can put out the lights that deceive them. Extinguish six Wandering Wisps at night in the Lorindor Elderwood and return for the Wardenry's payment. Further watches carry the same bounty.",
