  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "The Barnacle Pinchers on the Lorindor Shell Strand southeast from here have made our daytime shore patrol a rather undignified dance. Kill five by day so the wardens can walk their rounds. Leave the Bank Crabs alone; they have kept their side of the peace.",
