   "copper": 32,
   "description": "The Moss-Antler Stags are stripping bark faster than the roots can mend, and affection alone will not save the trees. Cull six by day in the Lorindor Paleroots, which lie in the northeast of Lorindor. Their yellow names mean they will not attack first; choose your quarry, and take no more than I ask.",
